human_labels.body:
It solves the issue because before this change the panic is recovered and so the http connection is not aborted (the recoverer sends a 500 status code). 

After this change we have:

```
if rvr == http.ErrAbortHandler {
	// we don't recover http.ErrAbortHandler so the response
	// to the client is aborted
	panic(rvr)
}
```

and so if the error is `http.ErrAbortHandler` the panic is not recovered anymore.

